OL,3,GNEWSA'Historic pub reopens' and 'dead
OL,4,Afish in river'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHere's our weekly roundup of stories
OL,7,Ffrom across local websites in the West
OL,8,Fof England.
OL,10,FAvon Wildlilfe Trust reported on a
OL,11,F"significant number" of dead fish
OL,12,Ffloating along a large stretch of the
OL,13,FRiver Banwell, close to the trust's
OL,14,FEbdon Farm site. It is not yet know
OL,15,Fwhat the cause is, but the charity said
OL,16,Fthe Environment Agency, which is
OL,17,Fresponsible for the river, had been
OL,18,Finformed.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
