OL,3,GNEWSA'Historic pub reopens' and 'dead
OL,4,Afish in river'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChanges are being introduced at
OL,7,FBurnham-on-Sea's minor injuries unit
OL,8,Ffrom 7 September to stabilise the
OL,9,Fservice following a summer of unplanned
OL,10,Fclosures. Staff from local GP practice,
OL,11,FSymphony North Healthcare, will be
OL,12,Fdrafted in to support the unit before
OL,13,Frunning the service at the hospital
OL,14,Ffrom 5 October.
OL,16,FThe owners of a 400-year-old pub near
OL,17,FBath has announced it will be reopening
OL,18,Fafter spending almost a year closed,
OL,19,Faccording to Somerset Live. The Old
OL,20,FCrown Inn at Kelston shut its doors
OL,21,Flast November after the manager left
OL,22,Fthe job for personal reasons.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
